.TH "CSSROTATE.Y" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSRotate.y \- CSSRotate: y property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]y\f[B]\f[R] property of the \f[CR]CSSRotate\f[R]
interface gets and sets the ordinate or y\-axis of the translating
vector.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSNumericValue\f[R].
Can be set to a number, which is wrapped in a \f[CR]CSSUnitValue\f[R] of
\f[CR]unit: \(dqnumber\(dq\f[R].
.SH EXAMPLES
